<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-W  AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-W  AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.45 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.72 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.65 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Sales		    8.03 vs   7.96</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.87 vs   1.53</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.27 vs   2.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.71 vs   2.06</p>
<p> Sales		   55.07 vs  44.44</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
